Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.58,0:02:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,《冰川时代2：融冰之灾》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.95,0:03:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我说, 这全球变暖真快热死我了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh boy! This global warming is killing me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.37,0:03:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这样太热，冰河世纪又太冷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is too hot, the Ice Age was too cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.46,0:03:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,怎样才能让你高兴啊!?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would it take to make you happy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.95,0:03:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这我喜欢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This I like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.28,0:04:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,哦! 你别想抓住我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, you won't catch me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.37,0:04:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯，不能跑，这是夏令营的规定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No running, James. Camp rules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.80,0:04:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,来抓我呀，树獭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make me, sloth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.71,0:04:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,应该叫我先生! 待人尊重{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make me, sir. It's all about respect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.14,0:04:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,高台跳水{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Water ball.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.85,0:04:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,山米, 刚吃过饭不能剧烈运动!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sammy, you just ate. Wait an hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.26,0:04:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,海克托! 不! 不! 那不能尿尿!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hector, no, no, no, you can't pee-pee there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.85,0:04:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧，在那儿也行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, there is fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.03,0:04:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,艾什莉，别抠鼻孔...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ashley, stop picking your...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.85,0:04:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,打糖果娃娃咯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pińata!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.52,0:04:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你们该先戴眼罩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! You're supposed to wear blindfolds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.82,0:04:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.82,0:04:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喂  该我打树獭了 - 该我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, it's my turn to hit the sloth. - Mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.53,0:04:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 该我 - 该我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mine. - Mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.04,0:04:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你肚子里怎么没糖果？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you didn't have any candy in you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.75,0:04:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那就埋了他! - 好!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's bury him. - Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.96,0:05:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  孩子们怎么可以虐待树懒?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, whoa. Who said you kids could torture the sloth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.13,0:05:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,曼尼，别扼杀了孩子们的创造力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manny, don't squash their creativity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.01,0:05:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,曼尼! 迪亚戈! 我贴心贴背的好哥们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Manny, Diego, my bad mammals-jammals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.02,0:05:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,拉我一把吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wanna give a sloth a hand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.69,0:05:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我的夏令营开张了 名字叫“希德领域”{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I opened my camp. "Campo del Sid".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.83,0:05:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,意思是“希德的夏令营”{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means Camp of Sid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.52,0:05:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜，两种语言中，你都叫傻瓜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations. You're now an idiot in two languages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.49,0:05:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,别在这些小屁孩面前说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not in front of the k-i-d-z.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.45,0:05:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,小家伙们爱死我了 对吧，比利？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These little guys love me. Right, Billy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.24,0:05:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,别逼我吃了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't make me eat you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.58,0:05:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,小子 所以说童言无忌嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They kid. That's why they're called kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.87,0:05:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我早说了, 希德, 要管一个营地你还不够格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you, Sid. You're not qualified to run a camp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.75,0:05:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,从几时起照看孩子也要看资格了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do qualifications have to do with childcare?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.59,0:05:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,再说，这些孩子以我为榜样呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, these kids look up to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.24,0:05:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我是他们的榜样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a role model to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.59,0:05:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,看得出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.10,0:05:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你们总觉得我是无能之辈, 可我也是这集体的一份子呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys never think I can do anything, but I'm an equal member of this herd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.68,0:05:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我建立了这集体,从现在起, 你们最好对我放尊重些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I made this herd, so you need to start treating me with some respect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.07,0:06:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 行了, 希德! - 希德, 我们说着玩的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, Sid. - Sid, we were just kidding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.44,0:06:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿! 我们来给毛象钉尾巴!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, let's play pin-the-tail-on-the-mammoth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.41,0:06:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好! - 希德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah! - Sid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.08,0:06:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我有能耐我怕谁!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can do stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.20,0:06:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就是不把我放在眼里!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Won't give me their stupid respect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.79,0:06:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,等着瞧吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll show 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.42,0:06:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,所以...最后... 小驴子终于找到妈妈了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so, in the end, the little burro reached his mommy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.34,0:06:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,从此他们过着幸福快乐的日子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they lived happily ever after.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.06,0:06:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好样的 - 我有问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good job. - Question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.44,0:06:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么小驴子要回家？ 怎么不和小兔子在一块儿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why does the burro go home? Why doesn't he stay with the rabbits?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.98,0:06:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,因为...因为他想和家人在一块儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because... because he wanted to be with his family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.94,0:06:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为他该去找驴小妹 多美丽的爱情故事呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He should go with the girl burro. That's a better love story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.40,0:06:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,下次你讲小驴子的故事, 就让他谈情说爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, well, when you tell your burro story, that's what he'll do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.12,0:06:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,小驴子难听死了, 严格说来应该叫他“野驴”{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Burro is a demeaning name. Technically, it's called a wild ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.12,0:06:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧, 野驴小子回到了家, 找到了他的野驴老妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine. The wild ass boy came home to his wild ass mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.21,0:07:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我才叫它小驴子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, that's why I called it a burro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.38,0:07:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,小驴子应该很可怜，没得吃 这样才会感人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could the burro have a grazing problem? Then he'd be more relatable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.09,0:07:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 无趣 - 没说服力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Boring. - It's not believable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.68,0:07:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 大驴会吃小驴吗？ - 故事的结局不够完美{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do burros eat their young? - It's not a good ending.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.31,0:07:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那样的话我都想吐了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes I throw up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.27,0:07:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他们从此幸福的生活在一起! 没有比这结局更让人满意的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They lived happily ever after. You can't get more satisfying than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.81,0:07:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,一个幸福的大家庭，本来就该这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One big, happy family. That's the way it's supposed to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.82,0:07:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那你的“幸福的大家庭”在哪儿呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's your big, happy family?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.28,0:07:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,然后, 饥饿的老虎, 吃了讨厌的小孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then the hungry tiger ate the pesky little kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.50,0:07:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧, 伙计? - 当然，怎会不好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You OK, buddy? - Sure. Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.08,0:07:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我以为... - 时间到了，故事结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I thought... - Story time's over. The end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.05,0:07:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 让路...别挡道 - 大家要去哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Run for your lives! - Where's everybody going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.09,0:07:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 世界末日要来了 - 你说什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The world's coming to an end. - What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.26,0:07:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,去问东尼，世界要被洪水淹了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fast Tony,he says the world's gonna flood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.64,0:07:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,各位! 我手上的装备威力无比{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Folks, I hold in my hand a device so powerful,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.43,0:07:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,它能把空气从天上抽下来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it can actually pull air right out of the sky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.77,0:07:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,跟真的一样!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.94,0:08:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,都过来! 都过来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gather round, gather round.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.40,0:08:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,请教一下你有腮吗, 女士?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pardon me, do you have gills, ma'am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.98,0:08:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那你没法在水下呼吸!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you can't breathe underwater?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.61,0:08:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我的这位助手将向你演示{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My assistant here will demonstrate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.03,0:08:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿! 有一股海洋的气息!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I can smell the ocean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.57,0:08:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛? 现在卖不出去了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing? I can't sell that now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.91,0:08:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,应该插在嘴里, 白痴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You suck air through your mouth, you moron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.91,0:08:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,有了我伟大的发明，再按照我教的去做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Through its design and sturdy construction,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.04,0:08:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,几兆年你也不会缺空气啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'll have plenty of air for eons to come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.45,0:08:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,当然啦, 效果因人而异{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, results may vary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.79,0:08:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你干嘛要用世界末日来吓人？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you scaring everybody with this doomsday stuff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.17,0:08:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我是想混口饭吃啊，老兄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to make a living here, pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.38,0:08:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我精准的气象预报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my weather forecast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.88,0:08:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,预计未来5天会有特大洪水{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The five-day outlook calls for intense flooding{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.68,0:08:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,然后就是世界的末日!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}followed by the end of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.10,0:08:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,本周后几天或许会有少许阳光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a slight chance of patchy sunshine later in the week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.22,0:08:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,得了...别听他那一套{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, don't listen to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.01,0:08:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他为点蝇头小利连老妈都会卖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fast Tony would sell his own mother for a grape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.10,0:08:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你这算出价吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you making an offer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.45,0:08:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,别误会! 那种事我不干!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, no, I would not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.78,0:08:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你没听说，冰正在溶化吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Haven't you heard? The ice is melting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.40,0:09:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你们瞧，这地整个被冰盖住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see this ground, it's covered in ice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.82,0:09:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,一千年前它就被冰覆盖着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A thousand years ago, it was covered in ice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.32,0:09:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,一千年以后, 它还是会盖着冰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A thousand years from now, it will still be ice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.16,0:09:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,老兄，我不是怀疑你求生的本能...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say, buddy, not to cast aspersions on your survival instincts or nothing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.58,0:09:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,但是猛犸象似乎快绝种了吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but haven't mammoths pretty much gone extinct?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.96,0:09:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你什么意思?？ - 我是说...“你”好像是最后一只猛犸象了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you talking about? - About you being the last of your kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.13,0:09:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你满嘴臭蚂蚁味{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your breath smells like ants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.93,0:09:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,就算是吧，你最后见过另一只猛犸象是什么时候？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be that as it may, when's the last time you saw another mammoth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.52,0:09:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,别听他胡说八道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't pay any attention to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.60,0:09:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,猛犸象怎么会绝种! 它们是地球上最大的生物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mammoths can't go extinct. They're the biggest things on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.69,0:09:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那恐龙呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the dinosaurs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.65,0:09:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,因为恐龙太狂妄，树敌太多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The dinosaurs got cocky and made enemies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.15,0:09:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧! 有个傻瓜要跳悬崖自杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look. Some idiot's going down the Eviscerator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.53,0:09:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,最好不是我们的白痴朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please tell me that's not our idiot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.24,0:09:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦! 现在我数到三就要往下跳了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, I'm gonna jump on the count of three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.12,0:09:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,1...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.83,0:09:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,2...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.13,0:09:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,希德别乱动，我们上来救你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sid, don't move a muscle. We're coming up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.67,0:10:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,跳! 跳! 跳!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jump! Jump! Jump!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.63,0:10:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,跳! 跳! 跳!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jump! Jump! Jump!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.72,0:10:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.30,0:10:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,2 又千分之 3, 2 又千分之 4{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two and three one-thousandths, two and four one-thousandths...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.14,0:10:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,希德! 你这是干嘛! 你快下来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sid, what are you doing? Get down from there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.89,0:10:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,决不，我要成为第一个跳悬崖的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I'm gonna be the first to jump off the Eviscerator{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.90,0:10:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,以后你们就得尊敬我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then you guys are gonna have to show me some respect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.36,0:10:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你跳下去的话 只能得到我们对死人的尊敬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only respect you'll get is respect for the dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.61,0:10:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,算了吧，曼尼，他没傻到那份上!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Manny, he's not that stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.66,0:10:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不过我也曾猜错 - 神兵天降...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But I've been wrong before. - Geronimo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.75,0:10:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, watch it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.46,0:10:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能呼吸了 我的五脏六腑全走样了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't breathe. I think I just coughed up my spleen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.77,0:11:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 迪亚戈 把爪子收回去 - 对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Diego, retract the claws, please. - Right. Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.74,0:11:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,幸好我还了解你, 迪戈, 不然我会以为你怕水{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I didn't know you better, Diego, I'd think you were afraid of the water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.24,0:11:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧, 好吧, 了解你是我的福气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, OK. Good thing I know you better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.87,0:11:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,大伙儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.58,0:11:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我想快脚东尼说对了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fast Tony was right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.87,0:11:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的东西都在溶化{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything is melting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.11,0:11:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,要发洪水了 快 我们得去警告大家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all gonna flood. Come on, we gotta warn them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.53,0:11:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,或许可以把这里变成水上乐园{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we can rapidly evolve into water creatures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.53,0:11:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你真天才，希德 - 叫我“鱿鱼”吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's genius, Sid. - Call me Squid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.00,0:12:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这地方简直成垃圾堆了, 我竟然住在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This whole thing's a piece ofjunk. I can't believe I live here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.92,0:12:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么啦？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.01,0:12:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不说芦苇啦, 我隆重推出革新小发明, 它名字叫...树皮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget reeds. I present you with this revolutionary gizmo we call bark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.10,0:12:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 轻凿一片, 漂浮水面 - 我来告诉你 什么可以浮吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's so buoyant, it actually floats. - I'll show you something that floats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.81,0:12:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧! 你们全死定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, it's your funeral.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.24,0:12:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧瞧, 末日来临就是这景象!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See? This is exactly what I'm talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.00,0:12:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,猛犸象一般大的“绒”岩浆球从天而降{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Giants balls of furry lava the size of mammoths raining from the sky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.04,0:12:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你去用芦苇管吸空气吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go suck air through a reed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.88,0:12:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,各位，他说得对，洪水要来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to him. He's right about the flood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.26,0:12:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我说得对？ 我是说...当然对啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am? I mean, yes, I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.51,0:12:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你就是那个说不会有洪水的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. You said there wasn't going to be a flood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.10,0:12:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们为什么要相信你？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why should we listen to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.18,0:12:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们在上面亲眼所见 冰坝快破了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because we saw what's up there. The dam's gonna break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.23,0:13:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,整个山谷会被水淹没{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The entire valley's gonna flood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.65,0:13:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,真的会有洪水! 而且很快就会来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flood's real, all right. And it's coming fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.53,0:13:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧瞧周围, 你们在盆地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look around. You're in a bowl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.91,0:13:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,盆里的水就快满了，而且水也没出口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bowl's gonna fill up. Ain't no way out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.74,0:13:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们怎么办?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.95,0:13:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你们能逃到山谷的尽头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless you make it to the end of the valley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.71,0:13:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那儿有一条船, 它能救你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a boat. It can save you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.54,0:13:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我什么都看不见 - 不过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't see anything. - But{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.59,0:13:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,要走趁早{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}y'all better hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.00,0:13:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,大地在融化, 冰墙在瓦解, 岩石在爆裂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ground's melting, walls tumbling, rocks crumbling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.58,0:13:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,要想活命, 就得跟洪水赛跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Survive that and you'll be racing the water,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.67,0:13:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,三天之内，洪水就会来到这冰川之地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}cos in three days' time, it's gonna hit the geyser fields.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.09,0:13:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,轰隆!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.14,0:13:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，有个好消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is some good news, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.85,0:13:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你们死得越多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The more of you die,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.98,0:13:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我就吃得越饱!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the better I eat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.27,0:13:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我可没说，是你们的好消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't say it was good news for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.94,0:14:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,让他来我课堂教书也不错！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He must have been a real pleasure to have in class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.76,0:14:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,什么鬼坝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.81,0:14:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,秃鹰说的都听到了吧，我们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, you heard the scary vulture. Let's move out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.31,0:14:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,曼尼，你认为真的有船吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manny, you really think there's a boat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.90,0:14:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这我不敢说，可过不了几天这儿就成一片汪洋了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, but in a few days, this place is gonna be underwater.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.61,0:14:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那个方向，是我们唯一的活路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there's any hope, it's that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.26,0:15:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,曼尼，快走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manny, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.61,0:15:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,最右线车道被倒塌的冰崖所阻 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Overturned glyptodont in the far right lane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.16,0:15:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,放眼望去都是受阻的交通{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Traffic backed up as far as the eye can see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.83,0:15:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,哇，那里似乎有人死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it looks like there might be a fatality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.46,0:15:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,黑肉归我了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I call the dark meat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.25,0:15:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦! 大家快走吧! 来! 快快快! 进来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, everybody, let's go. Come on, come, come, come. Get in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.51,0:15:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 走吧! 爷爷! 快走吧!  - 我们得走啦!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, Grandpa, come on. - We have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.14,0:15:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是不走! 我生在洞里, 也要死在洞里!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm not leaving. I was born in this hole and I'll die in this hole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.98,0:16:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛非得带着这陀粪？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do we have to bring this crap?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.74,0:16:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们要去的地方也会有粪的啦 - 这可是我妈妈送我的礼物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm sure there's crap where we're going. - This was a gift from my mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.16,0:16:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦, 都跟上! 都跟上!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, keep it moving, keep it moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.28,0:16:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,曼尼! 我刚听说你要灭绝了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manny, I just heard you're going extinct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.16,0:16:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,喂，你还没学会做人处世前 先学学说话婉转一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, if you ever master hygiene, try working on sensitivity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.17,0:16:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不会绝种 - 孩子们，瞧 最后一只猛犸象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm not going extinct. - Kids, look. The last mammoth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.51,0:16:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,大概再也看不到另一只了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you probably won't see another one of those again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.84,0:16:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,听到了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.18,0:16:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我数数, 一, 二, 詹姆斯哪去了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, one, two, three... Where is James?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.30,0:17:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,斯图! 快点! 斯图!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stu. Come on, Stu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.76,0:17:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,快点离开这大冰块!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's blow this ice-cube stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.98,0:17:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,斯图{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.15,0:17:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,大伙儿，我们是这山谷里 第一个有了自己的活动房屋的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Folks, be the first in the valley to have your very own mobile home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.04,0:19:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 有一天当你想唱歌时 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Some day, when you're gonna sing ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.29,0:19:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 或想要人们的注意时 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ When you make us sing ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.20,0:19:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴，希德 - 好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shut up, Sid. - OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.88,0:19:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 那是什么声音? 猛犸象全都入了土 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Stop, hey-hey...What's that sound..? All the mammoths are in the ground. ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.58,0:19:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,别唱了，希德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop singing, Sid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.43,0:19:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 如果传宗接代你就拍拍手 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ If you inherit the family, clap your hands

 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.23,0:20:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 如果你的... ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ If you... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.09,0:20:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,希德，你得小心我再压你身上, 这次我压死你!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sid, I'm going to fall on you again and this time I will kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.84,0:20:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧, 有人不喜欢经典老歌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, someone doesn't like the classics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.77,0:20:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,万一你真说对了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if you're right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.94,0:20:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,万一我真是最后一只猛犸象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if I am the last mammoth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.02,0:20:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,曼尼，往好处想想，起码你还有我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Manny, look at the bright side, you have us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.40,0:20:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这可不是什么好理由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not your most persuasive argument, Sid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.87,0:20:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 猛犸象？ - 我就知道我绝不是最后一只{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mammoths? - I knew I couldn't be the last one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.58,0:20:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这我有直觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I felt it in my gut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.59,0:20:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,绝种？ 少来！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Extinct? Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.35,0:20:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,曼尼全力冲刺 两人随行...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's up by a couple of fifths, ahead by a tusk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.52,0:21:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他就要战胜迪亚戈了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he's beating Diego as Diego's coming round the corner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.28,0:21:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我的肚子在跟我捣蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. My stomach hates me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.75,0:21:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,真是空前绝后的臭!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, don't that put the "stink" in extinction?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.33,0:21:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,真是恶心死了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nasty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.13,0:21:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,曼尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.01,0:21:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我想一个人静静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to be alone for a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.68,0:21:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你们先走吧 我随后就来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You go on ahead. I'll catch up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.48,0:21:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,“一”是世上最孤独的数字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One truly is the loneliest number.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.94,0:21:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这吹管真好用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These work great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.95,0:21:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,酷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.95,0:21:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没抓到，没抓到  - 我来逮他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Missed me, now you gotta kiss me. - I'll get 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.83,0:22:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他的哪一面在上？ - 我还以为那才是他的脸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Which end is up? - I'd hide that face too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.50,0:22:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗨, 丑八怪! - 噢! 屁股是用来坐的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, ugly. - I gotta sit on that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.72,0:22:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotcha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.02,0:22:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好了, 我要进去了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, I'm going in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.85,0:22:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 希德 - 怎么啦？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sid. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.27,0:22:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 射得好 - 注意背后!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nice miss. - Cover your side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.15,0:22:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我感觉有风 - 笑一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I felt some breeze in that one. - Smile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.95,0:22:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来抓我呀 - 喂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Out of my way. - Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.96,0:22:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,希德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sid{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.91,0:22:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.54,0:22:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 投降吗？ - 决不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Surrender? - Never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.37,0:22:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,酷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.75,0:22:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,往下射{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smoke them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.22,0:22:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,有谁问起, 就说他们有 50个, 而且他妈是响尾蛇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If anyone asks, there were 50 of 'em and they were rattlesnakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.97,0:23:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来呀, 小猫咪 - 别搞错了, 两个小无赖!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here, kitty, kitty. - Big mistake, you miscreants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.10,0:23:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,小无赖?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miscreants?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.69,0:23:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,迪亚戈，他们是负鼠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diego, they're possums.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.40,0:23:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,撤退{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Retreat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.34,0:23:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我想就剩你和我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess it's just you and me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.98,0:23:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道，不可能只有我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew it. I knew I wasn't the only one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.90,0:24:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,对呀，每个人都会从树上摔下来 只是他们不肯承认罢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone falls out of the tree now and then. They just don't admit it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.11,0:24:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，你说什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.78,0:24:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,要我们抓着那些树枝谈何容易{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some of us have a tough time holding on to branches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.53,0:24:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们又不是蝙蝠什么的, 我们没有翅膀来保持平衡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not like we're bats or something. We don't have wings to keep us up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.70,0:24:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你在...树上...因为...？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you were in the tree because...?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.00,0:24:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我在找我兄弟，他们老是惹麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was looking for my brothers. They are always in trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.50,0:24:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟？ 你是说...还有更多？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brothers? You mean there's more?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.13,0:24:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,当然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.92,0:24:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们一大堆哦 - 哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's lots of us. - Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.84,0:24:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,到处都是 石头地下，地洞里面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everywhere. Under rocks. In holes in the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.30,0:24:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们通常在夜里出来, 免得被鸟抓着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Usually we come out at night so birds don't carry us off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.60,0:24:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,救命啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help! Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.85,0:24:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,救命啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.06,0:24:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,哇！我得改姓了 你居然又找到一只猛犸象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, shave me down and call me a mole rat. You found another mammoth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.49,0:24:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里？ 等等，我还以为猛犸象绝种了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where? Wait a minute. I thought mammoths were extinct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.87,0:24:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们看着我干嘛？ - 不知道...或许因为你是猛犸象吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you looking at me for? - I don't know. Because you're a mammoth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.70,0:24:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我？别扯啦，我才不是猛犸象，我是负鼠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me? Don't be ridiculous. I'm not a mammoth. I'm a possum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.33,0:25:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,对呀，说得好 我是大角羚羊，他是我朋友獾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. Good one. I'm a newt. This is my friend, the badger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.42,0:25:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我另一位朋友鸭嘴兽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And my other friend, the platypus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.55,0:25:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不要做鸭嘴兽，让他做吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do I gotta be the platypus? Make him the platypus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.30,0:25:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这些人找你麻烦吗，姐姐？- 姐姐？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This guy giving you trouble, sis? - Sis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.68,0:25:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,对呀，他们是我弟弟 负鼠 负鼠 负鼠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right. These are my brothers. Possum, possum, possum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.27,0:25:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,她脑子里八成是哪根筋搭错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think her tree goes all the way to the top branch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.23,0:25:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,曼尼, 都快灭绝了, 就别挑三拣四了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manny, brink of extinction's a bad time to be picky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.32,0:25:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,有了，邀她与我们同行吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, she should come with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.61,0:25:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯啦，不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you insane? No way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.28,0:25:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.91,0:25:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,曼尼请你们跟我们一起躲避洪水{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manny wants me to ask you if you'd like to escape the flood with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.08,0:25:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我宁愿暴死街头 - 这好办{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'd rather be road kill. - That can be arranged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.63,0:25:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,真逗! 我来和我弟弟谈谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Funny. Let me have a little word with my brothers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.30,0:25:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,艾丽你疯啦，我们才不要跟他们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellie, are you crazy? We're not going with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.38,0:25:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,听着，我们如果只能晚上走，一定赶不及{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, we'll never make it in time if we only travel at night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.80,0:25:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这些家伙能在路上保护我们, 怎么样?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These guys can protect us out in the open. What do you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.83,0:26:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你干吗邀请他们?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you invite them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.23,0:26:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你们可能是世上剩的最后两只猛犸象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cos you might be the only two mammoths left on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.52,0:26:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他说得对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has a point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.82,0:26:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起, 我几时参加两情一线牵了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, when did I join this dating service?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.90,0:26:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我和弟弟们很高兴和你们一起走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My brothers and I would be delighted to come with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.24,0:26:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你们对我们客气点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you treat us nicely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.62,0:26:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了吧，这就是很不友善{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See that? That's the total opposite of nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.29,0:26:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,上路前能吃点心也不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we'll have a snack before we hit the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.04,0:26:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你想吃了我们？ 放马过来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want a piece of us? Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.29,0:26:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,炸弹开花！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Banzai!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.17,0:26:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我来逮他...噢 - 退后！退后！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I got 'em. - Back! Back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.30,0:26:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的绝招是...身上有病菌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know the best part? We're carrying diseases.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.27,0:26:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦，由于希德的促成，我们才能同行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, thanks to Sid, we're now travelling together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.15,0:26:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你高兴与否，我们都得像个大家庭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And like it or not, we're going to be one big, happy family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.94,0:26:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我是爸爸，艾丽是妈妈 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be the daddy, Ellie will be the mommy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.86,0:26:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,迪亚戈是叔叔，专门负责吃掉惹毛我的小孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Diego will be the uncle who eats the kids who get on my nerves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.87,0:26:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,趁脚下的地还没垮之前，快走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, let's move it before the ground falls out from under our feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.83,0:27:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为肥仔都很和气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought fat guys were supposed to be jolly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.83,0:27:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不肥！是毛让我看起来很巨大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not fat. It's this fur, it makes me look big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.13,0:27:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 毛太松散了 - 哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's poofy. - OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.13,0:27:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,就是肥嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's fat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.54,0:27:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,各位，为了逃洪灾 现在正是减肥的好时机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Escaping the flood is the perfect time to shed those unsightly pounds{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.71,0:27:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,快来买快脚东尼的“逃难减肥餐”{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with Fast Tony's Disaster Diet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.42,0:27:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,夫人，你看起来像毛茸茸的大怪兽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, ma'am, you look like a big, fat, hairy beast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.89,0:27:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,减个一、两吨的肥肉如何？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How would you like to lose a ton or two?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.97,0:28:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,正合我意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would I ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.64,0:28:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,薇拉，别听他的 你已经苗条的像根竹竿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't listen to him, Vera. You're already thin as a twig.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.48,0:28:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,朋友，我正好也有秘方 专治你你快瞎的眼睛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I also have the perfect cure for your eyesight, my blind friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.88,0:28:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,照这种速度，永远也到不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll never make it at this pace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.96,0:28:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,艾丽，现在很安全，你可以卸下伪装了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellie, it's OK, you can lose the camouflage. You're safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.47,0:28:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好 安全？ 少来！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK. Safe? Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.43,0:28:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你俩儿去探个路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crash, Eddie, you two go scope it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.56,0:28:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你看到什么？ - 队长，前方看似安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What you got? - Perimeter all clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.85,0:28:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 知道了，完毕 - 嗯...完毕...噢！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Roger that. One-niner, over. - Roger, over, victor...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.90,0:29:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喂？ - 安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Guys. - All clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.32,0:29:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,老鹰！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hawk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.37,0:29:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们在干嘛？ - 装死呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing? - Playing dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.29,0:29:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 曼尼，你为什么不装死？ - 因为...我是猛犸象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Manny, why don't you do that? - Because I'm a mammoth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.30,0:29:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,但你会装着玩，对吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you'd do it for treats, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.55,0:29:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,它走了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he gone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.10,0:29:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你安全了，起来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're safe. Get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.23,0:29:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,哎哟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.44,0:29:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,还好有你在，不然那老鹰 一定会冲下来把我抓去当晚餐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you weren't here, that hawk would have swooped down and snatched me for dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.98,0:29:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我的表弟维尔敦就这下场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how cousin Wilton went.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.78,0:29:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,哎哟, 我可真同情你, 真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boy, I really feel for you. I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.16,0:29:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你们这物种就剩你一头了, 这种滋味我真是没法想象!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't even imagine what it'd be like to be the last one of your species.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.54,0:29:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不是最后一只 - 你真有颗伟大勇敢的心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm not the last one. - You brave, brave soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.08,0:30:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,没错，决不放弃希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right. Don't give up hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.59,0:30:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,艾丽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.71,0:30:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,看看我们的脚印{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at our footprints.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.63,0:30:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,一样的形状{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're the same shape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.43,0:30:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎知那些不都是你的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, how do I know those aren't your footprints?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.18,0:30:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,呃  那么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.31,0:30:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,看看我们的影子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}look at our shadows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.68,0:30:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,很吻合{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We match.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.06,0:30:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你对啦，果然一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right. They're the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.86,0:30:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那你一定也是负鼠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be part possum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.20,0:30:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你想得美!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.29,0:30:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,迪亚戈，连地都走得比你快 快吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diego, there are whole continents moving faster than you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.59,0:30:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得赶上前面的大队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta catch up with the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.89,0:31:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  别闹了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Knock it off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.73,0:31:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,别唧唧哇哇的, 就像大老虎, 找点乐子吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cry me a river, blubber-tooth tiger. Have some fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.65,0:31:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这冰已经够薄了, 经不住你们这么闹腾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ice is thin enough without you two wearing it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.90,0:31:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,得了 迪亚戈 冰虽然薄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diego, come on. The ice may be thin{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.16,0:31:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,还能承受 十吨重的猛犸象和九吨重的“负鼠”{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it's strong enough to hold a ten-ton mammoth and a nine-ton possum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.39,0:31:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,有人落水啦！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mammal overboard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.66,0:32:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,艾丽, 快起来! 你再装死, 就死定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellie, get up. If you play dead, you'll be dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.50,0:32:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.05,0:32:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,迪亚戈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diego.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.10,0:32:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,迪亚戈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diego.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.03,0:32:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,快！ 迪亚戈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Diego. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.82,0:32:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,可能会有点儿痛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This may sting a little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.17,0:33:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是哪一种生物？- 不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What in the animal kingdom was that? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.47,0:33:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,现在起，陆上安全，水里不安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From now on, land-safe, water-not safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.35,0:33:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我见过最勇敢的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was the bravest thing I've ever seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.39,0:34:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 其实没什么啦...我... - 我可不是称赞你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It was nothing. I... - It's not a compliment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.40,0:34:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,对负鼠来说, 勇敢就是笨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To a possum, bravery is just dumb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.52,0:34:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对呀，我们没骨气 - 蔫了吧叽的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, we're spineless. - Lily-livered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.57,0:34:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,或许就是因为猛犸象爱逞能 才会弄得快要绝种了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe mammoths are going extinct because they get in danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.07,0:34:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,以后该学会逃命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you should run away more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.16,0:34:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,精辟呀! 谢谢你的忠告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good point. Thanks for the advice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.54,0:34:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,助人为乐嘛!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy to help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.41,0:34:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,她居然说这话? “勇敢就是笨, 以后该学会逃命”{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you believe her? "Bravery is dumb. Maybe you should run away more".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.04,0:34:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,她真让人生气，又固执，又没见识{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's infuriating and stubborn and narrow-minded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.21,0:34:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You like her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.55,0:34:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 才没 - 别担心，我会替你保密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I do not. - Don't worry. Your secret's safe with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.18,0:34:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还有你的秘密 - 什么秘密？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And so is yours. - What secret?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.93,0:34:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道的呀，就是你不会游泳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, the one where you can't swim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.77,0:34:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,荒谬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's ridiculous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.10,0:34:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,随你啦，但我们的世界快溶化了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine. But we're living in a melting world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.65,0:34:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你的那些恐惧也迟早要面对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to have to face your fear sooner or later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.29,0:35:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,到啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.51,0:35:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 准备好了吗，艾迪？ - 好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- OK. Ready, Eddie? - Set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.97,0:35:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,滚起来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's roll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.35,0:35:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,等等我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.23,0:36:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,别停啊 我先走一步 我在终点等你们吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No brakes. Gotta roll. Meet you at the other end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.11,0:36:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那么, 你真觉得她配我正合适?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you think she's the girl for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.12,0:36:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,对呀，她很有趣，你很无趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. She's tons of fun and you're no fun at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.37,0:36:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,她能补你的短{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She completes you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.17,0:36:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.79,0:36:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  曼尼 你可以用树枝把我射到那边的池塘吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Manny. Can you pull back the tree and shoot me into the pond?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.13,0:36:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不行 - 拜托啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.88,0:36:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你这样的态度怎能吸引艾丽呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You expect to impress with that attitude?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.18,0:36:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想讨她欢心!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to impress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.76,0:36:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那你干嘛要费尽唇舌 让她相信自己是猛犸象？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you trying to convince her she's a mammoth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.72,0:36:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,因为她就是！ 管她是否自认是负鼠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because that's what she is. I don't care if she thinks she's a possum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.48,0:36:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 总之不能同时是两种生物 - 正好相反，曼尼先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You can't be two things. - Au contraire, Man-fered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.94,0:36:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,例子有 牛蛙、龙鸟、还有熊猫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell that to the bullfrog, chicken hawk or turtledove.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.69,0:36:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你再啰唆，有得你瞧的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's never gonna let up on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.07,0:36:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你乖点儿，对大伙儿都有好处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll be easier on all of us if you just go with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.32,0:37:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你要我干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what do you want me to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.70,0:37:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,扳回树枝，把我射到那边的池塘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull the tree and shoot me into the pond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.25,0:37:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,能这样吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.87,0:37:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,呃...如果你没胆，我们可以去找艾丽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're too lame to do it, we can get Ellie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.88,0:37:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,别 别，我行 我行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. No, I can do it. I can do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.67,0:37:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶，好耶 快，快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, yeah, yeah. Come on, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.71,0:37:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你以前干过吗？- 才一百万次而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have you done this before? - Only a million times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.88,0:37:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,远点儿, 远点儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Farther, farther, farther.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.72,0:37:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好 发射{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect. Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.23,0:37:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我会飞啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah! I can fly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.32,0:37:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信我会飞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe I can fly..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.57,0:37:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,克来什？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crash!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.20,0:37:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,克来什！克来什！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crash! Crash!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.83,0:37:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 克来什，你没事吧？ - 怎么啦？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Crash, are you OK? - What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.50,0:37:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 曼尼把他往树上射 - 你是怎么回事啊？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Manny shot him out of a tree. - What's wrong with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.54,0:37:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他说没问题的呀！- 你还真相信他？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He said he could do it. - And you listened to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.96,0:37:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,克来什！去哪儿都行，可别去天国呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crash, whatever you do, don't go into the light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.43,0:37:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我能帮上什么忙吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I help in any way here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.68,0:38:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你帮得够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've done enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.18,0:38:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这下你高兴了吧 - 克来什！克来什！别离我而去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you happy now? - Crash, Crash, don't leave me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.64,0:38:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,谁能掩护我？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's gonna watch my back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.10,0:38:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,谁是我一起去捣蛋？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's gonna be my wingman of mayhem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.78,0:38:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,谁能和我一起滚树干？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's gonna roll in that dung patch with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.11,0:38:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,滚树干？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dung patch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.16,0:38:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等等 我的腿 我能站啦 - 他能站{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait. My legs. I can stand. - He can stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.98,0:38:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我能跑啦 - 他能跑...真是奇迹啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can run. - He can run. It's a miracle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.78,0:38:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢上苍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hallelujah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.05,0:38:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我还能说什么？ 他们是男孩儿 他们使我的生命更刺激{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can I say? They're boys. They make my life a little adventure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.13,0:38:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你们俩死定了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys are so dead. Thanks for embarrassing me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.46,0:38:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,别打脸!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not the face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.35,0:39:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,艾丽 艾丽 我也要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellie, Ellie, me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.77,0:39:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,她其实还不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's not half bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.19,0:39:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,有点儿疯狂，让人迷惑，但很甜美{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crazy and confused, but sweet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.78,0:39:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,又如何？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.32,0:39:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那你还犹豫什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what's holding you back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.16,0:39:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我的家人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.71,0:39:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以重组一个家庭呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can have that again, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.38,0:39:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不，希德，我不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Sid, I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.88,0:39:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦，好啦，但是，但是，你想想...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, OK, but think about it. I mean, if you let this chance go,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.47,0:39:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,如果错过这次机会，你的物种就会灭绝...太自私了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're letting your whole species go and that's just... that's just selfish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.10,0:39:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我大概还活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I'm starting to get through to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.65,0:39:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哈哈...等等...逮到你啦 - 你太慢啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait, wait. I got you. - Slowpoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.57,0:39:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 要帮忙吗？ - 不，不用，只是喘口气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Need help? - No, no. Just catching my breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.75,0:40:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你卡住了 - 我没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're stuck. - I am not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.54,0:40:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那好，我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, then, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.84,0:40:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.21,0:40:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我是卡住了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm stuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.92,0:40:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,用牙去抬树干，不是比较简单吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you think that picking them up like this would be easier?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.15,0:40:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,艾丽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.47,0:40:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道这地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.55,0:43:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,其实...我能感觉...我和他们不一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, deep down, I knew I was different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.14,0:43:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我比其他小负鼠们都大一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was a little bigger than the other possum kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.36,0:43:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦...大很多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, a lot bigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.65,0:43:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,哦...我终于明白为何 没有负鼠男孩喜欢我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I understand why the possum boys didn't find me appealing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.74,0:43:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,真可惜，不过对猛犸象来说，你...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's too bad, because as far as mammoths go, you're...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.74,0:43:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你知道的... - 知道什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- you know. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.66,0:43:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,很有魅力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attractive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.45,0:43:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的？ - 当然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Really? - Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.62,0:43:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我的哪里有魅力？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about me is attractive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.01,0:43:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.09,0:43:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,呃，你的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, there's your{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.76,0:43:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,臀部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}butt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.64,0:43:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我臀部怎样？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.14,0:43:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,很...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.35,0:43:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,丰满{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.68,0:44:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你只是随便说说罢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're just saying that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.40,0:44:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不...不是...我说真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, I mean it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.44,0:44:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,很丰满 我见过最丰满的臀部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's huge. Biggest darn butt I've ever seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.78,0:44:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你真好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is really sweet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.82,0:44:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,今天真是疯狂...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a crazy day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.16,0:44:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我早上起来还是负鼠 现在却成了猛犸象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This morning I woke up a possum and now I'm a mammoth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.81,0:46:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,哇塞，曼尼和艾丽今天进展神速{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boy, Manny sure took a big leap with Ellie today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.61,0:46:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,对呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.03,0:46:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然情势不明 但是曼尼终究还是奋勇向前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He stood on the shore of uncertainty and dove right in. Splash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.90,0:46:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他克服恐惧的方法很勇敢，对吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kind of brave, huh? The way he faced his fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.45,0:46:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我又不恐惧，怎么会知道？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't know. Sabres don't feel fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.75,0:46:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,少来啦，所有的动物都会恐惧 这就是动物和石头的分别{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, all animals feel fear. It's what separates us from, say, rocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.37,0:46:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,石头是没有恐惧的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocks have no fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.96,0:46:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 而且石头会沉 - 你倒底想说什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And they sink. - What are you getting at, Sid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.55,0:46:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,或许你会惊讶，我也曾有恐惧的经验{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It may surprise you to know that I, too, have experienced fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.51,0:46:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你？不会吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. You?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.39,0:46:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，当然  虽然似乎不可能...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Yes, as impossible as it seems,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.02,0:46:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,但是树獭有天敌 他们会伤害、甚至“吃掉”我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the sloth has natural enemies that would like to harm or otherwise "kill" us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.77,0:46:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 总有原因吧？ - 因为我们很美味{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I wonder why? - Jealousy, mostly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.61,0:46:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,但我要说的是...恐惧是天性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the point is that fear is natural.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.61,0:46:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,恐惧是属于猎物的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fear is for prey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.32,0:47:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那么...你就是水的猎物咯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then, you're letting the water make you its prey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.12,0:47:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,就这么跳下去，然后相信你的本能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Justjump in and trust your instincts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.12,0:47:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,很多动物从小就会游泳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, most animals can swim as babies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.92,0:47:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,对老虎来说，就像狩猎时 朝你可怜的猎物匍伏向前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And for a tiger, it's like crawling on your belly to stalk helpless prey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.63,0:47:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不过要快点儿，懂吧？ 扒，踢，扒，踢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But faster, OK? Now, claw, kick, claw, kick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.18,0:47:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我在潜近猎物 扒，踢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm stalking the prey. Claw, kick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.26,0:47:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,现在回头看，假装被跟踪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I look back over my shoulder to see if I'm being followed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.27,0:47:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,然后吸口气...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm breathing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.69,0:47:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我在潜近...我在潜近...然后...啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm stalking and I'm stalking and I'm...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.52,0:47:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我就摔下来了 - 纠正一下, 你沉下去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm falling. - Correction. You're sinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.99,0:47:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好像石头一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kind of like a rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.29,0:47:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,呼嘿，猛犸象有特殊技能吗，比方翻滚？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, do we do any special tricks like roll over?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.16,0:47:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,还是会用我们的身体左右摇晃？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or do we just throw our weight around?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.33,0:47:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoops. Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.17,0:47:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道自己的特长是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know my own strength yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.84,0:48:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,艾丽，你知道我们现在有机会 来拯救我们的物种吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellie, do you realise that now we have a chance to save our species?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.30,0:48:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的？ 怎么做？ - 呃...你知道的呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Really? How are we gonna do that? - Well, you know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.06,0:48:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚才是...？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you just...?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.02,0:48:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我才成为猛犸象五分钟 你就想勾引我！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not a mammoth for five minutes and you're hitting on me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.94,0:48:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是说...现在，是过一阵子啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't saying... Not right now. In time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.73,0:48:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是说...那是我们的责任{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was just saying that it's our responsibility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.36,0:48:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,什么!?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.82,0:48:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我...说错了...我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, that came out wrong. I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.70,0:48:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你很漂亮，不过我们才刚认识{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're very pretty, but we just met...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.87,0:48:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,责任？ 只是做你该做的，是吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Responsibility? Just doing your duty? Is that it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.33,0:48:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好要做最大的牺牲，来拯救你的物种{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready to make the ultimate sacrifice to save your species.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.41,0:48:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你说白了吧，你今晚不能拯救 哪一个晚上都不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got some news for you. You're not saving the species tonight or any other night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.13,0:48:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 呃...进展如何？ - 还不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So, how did it go? - Not bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.22,0:48:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦，我们走吧 白天我们跟你走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, let's go. We travelled with you all day,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.89,0:49:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上你们跟我走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}now you're coming with us at night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.69,0:49:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们晚上看不见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we can't see at night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.94,0:49:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那就好好享用洪水吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then enjoy the flood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.23,0:49:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我连看都不想看他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't even look at him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.03,0:49:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,变态！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pervert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.78,0:49:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,交朋友, 你走到哪儿都是这么交朋友的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Making friends everywhere you go. Just making friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.85,0:49:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小心! 有树桩 - 这会儿没了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Watch out, there's a stump. - Not anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.90,0:49:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我...以为大家可以走近点儿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought we could walk together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.53,0:49:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,克来什，去问他为什么会这么认为？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crash, ask the mammoth why he thinks that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.24,0:49:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,她说，她认为你是个痞子，要你走开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She said she thinks you're ajerk and to go away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.62,0:50:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,她没说...噢！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She didn't say...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.54,0:50:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我说...如果我们能多相处...噢！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, maybe if we spend more time...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.62,0:50:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他，我需要多一点儿私人空间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him that I need a little personal space right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.71,0:50:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她说你去跳湖 - 负鼠万岁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She said go jump in a lake. - And possums rule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.72,0:50:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我听不见她说什么 - 你想要什么...奖章？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can hear her, you know. - What do you want? A medal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.44,0:50:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,移一下位置{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.90,0:50:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢，呼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.54,0:50:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,曼尼，艾丽，牵鼻子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manny, Ellie. Lock trunks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.46,0:50:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,快！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.97,0:50:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,克来什，艾迪，抓住那边的危崖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crash, Eddie. Grab on to that ledge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.89,0:51:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在该怎么办？- 快...去做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Funny. Now what's your real plan? - Just do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.52,0:51:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 再见，艾迪 - 再见，克来什{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bye, Eddie. - Bye, Crash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.65,0:51:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 再见，艾丽 - 快去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bye, Ellie. - Go now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.40,0:51:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 如果我刚才说的冒犯了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry if what I said before offended you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.20,0:51:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,“如果”是什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean "if" it offended me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.04,0:51:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你“当然”冒犯了她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That it offended her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.54,0:51:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是说“如果”会冒犯了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean that, that it offended you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.25,0:51:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你只不过是反应过度 - 什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You just overreacted, that's all. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.01,0:51:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 收回你刚说的 - 你什么狗屁“反应过度”{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Take it back. - There are other lives at stake here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.97,0:51:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他说的有道理 - 毫无道理!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's got a point. - He's got nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.35,0:51:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 只是误会 - 说话不知检点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It was a misunderstanding. - It was insensitive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.31,0:51:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 道歉 - 为何要我道歉？是她反应过度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Apologise. - Why me? She overreacted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.18,0:51:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快道歉 - 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just apologise. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.52,0:51:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快 - 好吧，对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do it. - OK, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.52,0:51:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.07,0:51:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他说得对，是我反应过度 -  你是说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's right. I overreacted. - You mean...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.65,0:52:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,别说了，不然我过去给你一爪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not another word or I'll come down there and push you over myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.99,0:52:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it. I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.62,0:52:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.54,0:52:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,曼尼，艾丽，快跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manny, Ellie, run! Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.60,0:52:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我们终于一起做对了一件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess we finally did something right together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.23,0:52:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,呵  别管我，我只不过是挂在悬崖罢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, don't mind me. Just hanging off the edge of a cliff here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.34,0:53:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还记得以前的好日子吗？ - 什么好日子？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Remember the good old days? - Which good old days?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.47,0:53:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道的啦...昨天、上星期{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know. Yesterday, last week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.05,0:53:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那些孩子们在我们脚边嘻笑打闹的日子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back when the trees went up and down and the ground stayed under our feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.60,0:53:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,没错，那些的确是好日子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep. Those were the good days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.23,0:53:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那时候负鼠就是负鼠，猛犸象就是猛犸象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Possums were possums and mammoths were mammoths.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.77,0:53:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 该睡了 - 是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We should get some sleep. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.32,0:53:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,秃鹰说明天就是世界末日{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow's the day the vulture said we're all going to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.97,0:54:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.47,0:54:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你们需要帮忙吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.61,0:54:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯...这才叫“尊敬”{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, that's what I call respect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.82,0:55:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.21,0:55:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这里一定有人喜欢希德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody here likes Sid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.92,0:55:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,谁是设计师？ 简直太棒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is your decorator? I mean, this is fabulous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.97,0:55:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,火王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire King.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.56,0:55:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,火王？ 嗯 也该是有人注意到我潜能的时候了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire King? Well, you know, it's about time someone recognised my true potential.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.53,0:55:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,火来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let there be fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.05,0:55:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好烫，好烫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hot, Hot{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.39,0:56:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,要是大伙儿能看到我这么风光就好啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If only the guys could see me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.85,0:56:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是极好就是极坏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is either really good or really bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.15,0:56:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,别别别{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.40,0:56:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我是火王 为什么要杀火王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me Fire King. Why kill Fire King?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.94,0:57:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了千年火王对你们有什么好处？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A thousand years' bad juju for killing Fire King.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.45,0:57:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,极热的岩石从地心升起 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Super-heated rock from Earth's core is surging to the crust,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.58,0:57:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,溶化了千年的冰山{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}melting ice built up over thousands of years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.00,0:57:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你们有很高的文明 我们定能一起想出解决的好办法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a very advanced race. Together, we can look for a solution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.17,0:57:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经有办法了 牺牲火王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have one, sacrifice the Fire King.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.88,0:57:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这不太文明吧 - 值得一试{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, that's not very advanced. - Worth a shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.67,0:57:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.77,0:57:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他是恶咒!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bad juju!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.59,0:58:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,水! 水!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Water? Water!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.47,0:58:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉过你，睡前别喝水{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crash, I told you not to drink before bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.31,0:58:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我弄的啦 起码不全是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't do this. At least, not all of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.27,0:58:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事？ - 我们睡过头了，得快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's happening? - We overslept. We need to move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.77,0:58:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,万一我们是物种的最后两个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if we're the last creatures left alive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.07,0:58:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得在地球上繁衍生命!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll have to repopulate the Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.44,0:58:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么做？ 这里不是公的，就是我们的姊妹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How? Everyone's either a dude or our sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.74,0:58:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,噢  嗨  曼尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi. Hey, Manny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.66,0:58:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,哇，昨晚真神奇 你们一定猜不出来发生了何事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow. What a night. You'll never guess what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.71,0:58:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我敢打赌说你一定是梦游了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were sleepwalking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.24,0:58:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不不，我被迷你树獭族绑架了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. I was kidnapped by a tribe of mini sloths.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.91,0:58:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是我第二个猜测 - 他们崇拜我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That was gonna be my second guess. - And they worshiped me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.29,0:58:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然他们把我扔进融岩火坑 但是他们还是崇拜我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, sure, they tossed me into a flaming tar pit, but they worshiped me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.58,0:58:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,希德，你在作梦 快走吧，水升得比我们走得还快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were dreaming. Come on, the water's rising faster than we're moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.67,0:58:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚说啦，我被绑架，被崇拜 我...我...大伙儿...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm telling you, I was kidnapped. I was worshiped. Guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.93,0:58:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,呃...算了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.73,0:59:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,能慢点儿吗？ 我快死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we slow down a little? I'm dying here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.74,0:59:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是打个比方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was just a figure of speech.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.20,0:59:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他们一动也不动  看着我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They just sit there, watching us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.12,0:59:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,真希望能知道他们在想什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish I knew what they were thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.20,0:59:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,食物，神圣的食物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Food, glorious food...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.00,0:59:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,叫人垂涎三尺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're anxious to try it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.24,0:59:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,一日三回盛宴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three banquets a day...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.58,0:59:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们钟爱的食物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}our favorite diet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.41,0:59:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,想像一块长毛象肉排{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just picture a mammoth steak...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.32,0:59:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不论炸、烤或清炖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}fried, roasted....or stewed...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.35,0:59:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,噢，美味令人赞叹的食物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}food, wonderful food...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.22,0:59:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,神圣的食物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}marvelous food...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.19,0:59:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,食物，神圣的食物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Food, glorious food...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.53,1:00:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,神圣的食物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}glorious fooood!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.63,1:00:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,麻油负鼠酒冒着火舌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}poached possums or flamb?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.53,1:00:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,鲜煮树懒汤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Broth made from a sloth...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.40,1:00:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,烤奶油剑齿虎酥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or savored to souffl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.44,1:00:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,整天冥想怎会有如此命运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why should we debate it? True you've nothing, but food!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.31,1:00:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,噢，食物，神奇的食物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh...foood, magical food{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.15,1:00:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,奇妙令人赞叹的食物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wonderful food, marvelous foood!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.62,1:00:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,食物，神圣的食物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Food, glorious food...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.52,1:00:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,从死尸剥下的肉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flesh, picked off the dead ones!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.46,1:00:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不管发臭、腐烂还是被咬过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're famished for food...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.19,1:00:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,很快进了我们五脏庙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}soon, we'll be the fed ones!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.06,1:00:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,只要想到腐败的臭肉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just thinking of putrid meat...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.93,1:00:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,心情不禁飞扬起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}puts us in the mood!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.20,1:00:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,因为食物，神圣的食物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, food, glorious food...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.87,1:00:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,神奇的食物，美妙的食物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}marvelous food, wonderful food...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.84,1:00:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,美丽的食物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}beautiful food...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.78,1:00:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,神奇的食物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}magical food...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.88,1:00:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,神圣的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}glorious...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.38,1:00:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,食物!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Foood!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.18,1:01:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,现在知道他们在想什么了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There. Now you know what they were thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.13,1:01:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,食物，神圣的食物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Food, glorious food{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.60,1:01:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 希德 - 干嘛? 很容易朗朗上口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sid! - What? It's catchy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.91,1:01:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 成功了! - 总算没有让秃鹰看扁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We made it. - Yeah, we showed those scary vultures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.69,1:01:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,一点热水和蒸汽，算什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a little hot water and steam. How bad could it be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.57,1:02:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚刚有点失禁，拉了一屁股{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just did something involuntary and messy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.50,1:02:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦，走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.54,1:02:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,曼尼，回来!简直是地雷区{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manny. Get back. It's a minefield out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.29,1:02:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,唯一的办法是笔直通过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's only one way to go. Straight through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.34,1:02:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想死前被烫熟拔毛，谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Straight through? We'd like to keep the fur on our bodies, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.38,1:02:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们回头，绕过去 - 不!没时间了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We'll head back and go around. - There's no time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.76,1:02:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,水坝会溃堤淹死我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The dam will burst before we make it. We'll drown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.51,1:02:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,走过这里会被射成蜂窝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we go through this, we get blown to bits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.06,1:02:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 前进! - 回头!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We go forward. - We go back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.06,1:02:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 前进! - 回头!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Forward. - Back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.65,1:02:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我可以发言吗? - 不行!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I say something? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.98,1:02:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你很固执，刚愎自用 - 大概这就证据确凿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You are so stubborn and hard-headed. - Well, I guess that proves it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.95,1:02:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,证明我是真的长毛象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am a mammoth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.49,1:02:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们走 - 请便{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. - Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.83,1:02:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,淹死算是温和的死法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Drowning sounds like a much gentler way to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.29,1:02:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,射成蜂窝听起来...比较干脆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blown to bits sounds so sudden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.51,1:03:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他会害死自己 曼尼!等等!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's going to get himself killed. Manny, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.72,1:03:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,曼尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.41,1:03:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子们看!最后一头长毛象!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kids, look, the last mammoth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.28,1:03:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,听说你们快绝种了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just heard you're going extinct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.70,1:03:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 叫负鼠长毛象不伦不类 - 她觉得你很没品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You can't be two things. - She thinks you're ajerk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.41,1:03:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你幸福的大家庭呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's your big, happy family?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.25,1:03:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么毛病?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.92,1:03:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,曼尼!起来!要走了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manny, come on. We gotta go. Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.60,1:04:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那边!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.76,1:04:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,千万不要单独留下小孩 没人看顾的小孩将被吃掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not leave your children unattended. All unattended children will be eaten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.94,1:04:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有没有看到一头长毛象? - 没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have you seen a mammoth? - No, sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.02,1:04:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有没有看到一头长毛象? - 没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have you seen a mammoth? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.23,1:04:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,负鼠?大概11尺高{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Possum? About 11 foot tall?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.03,1:05:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有没有看到一头长毛象? - 近在眼前，巨大无比{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, buddy, have you seen a mammoth? - I sure have. Big as life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.49,1:05:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 在哪里? - 我正在看着他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where? - I'm looking at him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.66,1:05:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.00,1:05:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,可怜，不知道自己是长毛象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor guy doesn't know he's a mammoth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.73,1:06:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 到处都找不到她 - 说不定她上船了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't see her anywhere. - Maybe she's already on board.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.58,1:06:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,快!这边!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry, this way. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.87,1:06:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 在那里 - 艾丽，救我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There it is. - Ellie! Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.18,1:06:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,快!跑!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on, run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.94,1:06:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,用力推!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Push.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.65,1:07:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们走 - 我们不能丢下你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You guys gotta go. - We're not leaving you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.15,1:07:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我命令你们! - 艾丽，不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm not asking. - Ellie, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.16,1:07:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,艾丽，别怕!我们去找救兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellie, don't worry. We're going for help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.95,1:07:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不要走开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.34,1:07:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 救命! - 救命啊!救人啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Help us. - Help! Somebody help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.31,1:07:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,曼尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.60,1:07:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,曼尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.48,1:07:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 曼尼!  - 是艾丽，她陷在一个洞里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Manny. - It's Ellie, she's trapped in a cave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.08,1:08:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,艾丽!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.83,1:08:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,曼尼?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manny?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.92,1:08:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 救命啊! - 我来救你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Help! - I'll save you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.80,1:08:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这下好了，谁来救他?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. Who's gonna save him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.72,1:09:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你平常该多刷牙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really need to brush.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.10,1:09:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不要怕，跳进去...跳!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, OK, OK. Jump in now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.07,1:09:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,快跳，胆小猫，快点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, 'fraidy cat. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.61,1:09:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can do this, you can do this, you can do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.61,1:09:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,相信你的本能，攻击它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust your instincts. Attack the water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.07,1:09:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是水的猎物 我不是你的猎物!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not your prey. I am not your prey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.28,1:09:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是你的猎物!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not your prey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.77,1:09:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,攻击恶水，偷袭猎物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attack the water. Stalking the prey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.35,1:09:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,划!踢!连小婴儿都会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Claw, kick. Even babies can do it. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.98,1:10:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,划!踢!划!踢!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Claw, kick, claw, kick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.07,1:10:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿!我正在偷袭猎物!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. I'm stalking the prey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.08,1:10:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,艾迪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.76,1:10:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你成功了，击败了可恶的水{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did it, buddy. You kicked water's butt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.81,1:10:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么 动物大多从小会游泳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing to it. Most animals can swim as babies, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.31,1:10:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,可是老虎不会，我故意不说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but not tigers. I left that part out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.83,1:10:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他在那里!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.87,1:10:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,艾丽，抓住我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellie, hold on to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.20,1:11:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,曼尼!在你后面!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manny, Manny, behind you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.61,1:12:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在那里!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There they are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.70,1:12:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,安全脱险!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They made it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.30,1:12:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我们以为再也看不到你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We thought we'd never see you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.68,1:12:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会活下去!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.48,1:12:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会死翘翘!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.17,1:14:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我不走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm not leaving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.92,1:14:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,爷爷，放开船，洪水退了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grandpa, let go of the boat. The flood's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.05,1:14:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 它现在是我的船了 - 快点!走啦，走啦!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is my boat now. - Come on, let's go. Come on, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.10,1:14:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,史都，我们活下来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stu. We made it. We're gonna live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.27,1:14:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,至少...我还活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I am anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.11,1:15:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我想开一家游泳训练班{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm thinking about starting a swim school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.11,1:15:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,叫“希德乌贼补习班”{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sid's Squids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.49,1:15:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,火王万岁!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All hail Fire King.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.88,1:15:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.72,1:15:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,火王勇退洪水 加入我们，伟大高贵的猛男{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire King avert flood. Join us, O great and noble flaming one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.68,1:15:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,别急、别急，你开的条件不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not so fast there, OK. You make a quality offer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.94,1:15:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,但火王有别的承诺 这里的同伙需要他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Fire King has a prior commitment. His herd needs him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.03,1:15:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他是死缠烂打的橡皮糖 把我们都黏在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is the gooey, sticky stuff that holds us together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.41,1:15:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他是这伙人的灵魂 没有他我们活不下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He made this herd, and we'd be nothing without him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.33,1:15:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的? - 希德 希德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You mean it? - Sid. Sid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.04,1:16:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但不表示我想碰你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That doesn't mean "want to touch".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.59,1:16:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不要问原因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.07,1:17:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不是唯二的长毛象了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not the last ones anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.08,1:17:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你不来?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.17,1:17:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你想跟他们去?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna go with them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.50,1:17:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我是长毛象啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am a mammoth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.75,1:17:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,应该跟长毛像一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should probably be with a mammoth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.47,1:17:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得咧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.05,1:17:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,没错啦，除非...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, unless...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.85,1:17:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,除非什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.39,1:17:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,除非我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.19,1:17:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我想说的是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wanna say...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.94,1:17:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我想跟你说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to tell you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.07,1:17:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,希望你找到想要的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you find everything you're looking for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.37,1:17:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你也一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.69,1:18:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,曼尼? 我们认识后你有长足进步 这当然都是我的功劳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manny, you've come a long way since we met and I'll take full credit for that,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.66,1:18:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,可是你应该忘掉过去 追求你的未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you need to let go of the past so you can have a future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.70,1:18:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 去追她 - 没关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go after her. - It's OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.58,1:18:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们永远挺你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll always be here for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.54,1:18:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我会跟你们保持联系 - 知道啦，你够朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll keep in touch. - Yeah, yeah. You're a good friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.46,1:19:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,废话少说，快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Point made. Now, go on. Scat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.35,1:19:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的曼尼长大了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our Manny's growing up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.98,1:19:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,艾丽 艾丽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellie! Ellie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.19,1:19:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,曼尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.70,1:19:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,艾丽! 艾丽! 我们在一起不是因为情非得己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellie, I don't want us to be together because we have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.82,1:19:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,而是因为情投意合{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want us to be together because we want to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.54,1:19:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,艾丽，我想跟你在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I wanna be with you, Ellie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.41,1:19:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不知道你愿意吗? - 曼尼，我一直觉得...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you say? - Manny, I thought you were going...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.17,1:19:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你也有负鼠体贴的一面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're possum enough for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.82,1:20:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,只剩我们两个啦 两个光棍在原野任意闯荡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's just you and me now. Two bachelors knocking about in the wild.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.11,1:20:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,但我不背你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine. But I'm not gonna carry you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.53,1:20:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我还有尊严 - 看在以往的交情，别这样啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I still have my pride, you know. - Come on, buddy, for old time's sake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.33,1:20:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我背他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll carry him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.37,1:20:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 可是你的同类要走了 - 我要跟我的“同类”一起走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But your herd's leaving. - We are now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.38,1:20:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,哇!闪电结婚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shotgun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.09,1:20:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你比较喜欢谁?我还是迪亚戈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manny, who do you like better? Me or Diego?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.88,1:20:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 迪亚戈，你哪有得比 - 哈，我有没有跟你说过?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Diego. It's not even close. - Told you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.26,1:20:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,曼尼，对自己孩子不能偏心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manny, you can't choose between your kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.27,1:20:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我孩子? 他连宠物狗都算不上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not my kid. Not even my dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.39,1:20:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我养狗、狗生了小狗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I had a dog and my dog had a kid...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.02,1:20:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,小狗养宠物，那宠物才是希德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the dog's kid had a pet, that would be Sid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.73,1:20:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我可以养狗吗，曼尼? - 不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I have a dog, Manny? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.40,1:20:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 艾丽，我可以养狗吗? - 当然可以，亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ellie, can I have a dog? - Of course you can, sweetie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.40,1:20:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,艾丽，我们不能有两套标准{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellie, we have to be consistent with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.17,1:23:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我救了你一命，小家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saved you, little buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.90,1:23:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,生什么气，我救了你一命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calm down. I saved you, little buddy. Remember?{\r}
